  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Orc Knuckle Dagger",
      "quantity": 1,
      "description": "<p>This stout, metal blade of orc design has a horizontal basket hilt with blades jutting from each end, or sometimes one blade like that of a katar.</p>",
      "level": 0,
      "price": "7 sp ",
      "traits": [
        "uncommon",
        "agile",
        "disarm",
        "orc"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Alchemist's Fire (Moderate, Infused)",
      "quantity": 4,
      "description": "<p><strong>Activate</strong> <img src=\"assets/images/actions/1.png\" title=\"1 action\" alt=\"1 action\"> Strike</p>\n<p>Alchemist's fire is a combination of volatile liquids that ignite when exposed to air. Alchemist's fire deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d8</span> fire damage, 2 persistent fire damage, and 2 fire splash damage. You gain a +1 item bonus to attack rolls.</p>",
      "level": 3,
      "price": "10 gp ",
      "traits": [
        "alchemical",
        "bomb",
        "consumable",
        "fire",
        "infused",
        "splash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Frost Vial (Moderate, Infused)",
      "quantity": 4,
      "description": "<p><strong>Activate</strong> <img src=\"assets/images/actions/1.png\" title=\"1 action\" alt=\"1 action\"> Strike</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The liquid reagents in this vial rapidly absorb heat when exposed to air. A frost vial deals the listed cold damage and cold splash damage. On a hit, the target takes a status penalty to its Speeds until the end of its next turn. Many types of frost vial also grant an item bonus to attack rolls.</p>\n<p>You gain a +1 item bonus to attack rolls, the bomb deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> cold damage and 2 cold splash damage, and the target takes a -10-foot penalty.</p>\n",
      "level": 3,
      "price": "10 gp ",
      "traits": [
        "alchemical",
        "bomb",
        "cold",
        "consumable",
        "infused",
        "splash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Studded Leather Armor",
      "quantity": 1,
      "description": "<p>This leather armor is reinforced with metal studs and sometimes small metal plates, providing most of the flexibility of leather armor with more robust protection.</p>",
      "level": 0,
      "price": "3 gp ",
      "traits": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Crafter's Eyepiece",
      "quantity": 1,
      "description": "<p>This rugged metal eyepiece etched with square patterns is designed to be worn over a single eye. Twisting the lens reveals a faint three-dimensional outline of an item you plan to build or repair, with helpful labels on the component parts.</p>\n<p>While worn, this eyepiece gives you a +1 item bonus to Crafting checks. When you Repair an item, increase the Hit Points restored by 15 per proficiency rank instead of 10.</p>",
      "level": 3,
      "price": "60 gp ",
      "traits": [
        "invested",
        "magical"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Bomber's Eye Elixir (Lesser)",
      "quantity": 1,
      "description": "<p><strong>Activate</strong> <img src=\"assets/images/actions/1.png\" title=\"1 action\" alt=\"1 action\"> Interact</p>\n<p>This tincture lets you pinpoint your foes. For the next 5 minutes, your alchemical bomb Strikes reduce the circumstance bonus to AC your targets gain from cover by 1.</p>",
      "level": 4,
      "price": "14 gp ",
      "traits": [
        "alchemical",
        "consumable",
        "elixir"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Elixir of Life (Lesser, Infused)",
      "quantity": 2,
      "description": "<p><strong>Activate</strong> <img src=\"assets/images/actions/1.png\" title=\"1 action\" alt=\"1 action\"> Interact</p>\n<p>Elixirs of life accelerate a living creatures natural healing processes and immune system. Upon drinking this elixir, you regain <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">3d6+6</span> healing Hit Points and gain +1 item bonus to saving throws against diseases and poisons for 10 minutes.</p>\n",
      "level": 5,
      "price": "30 gp ",
      "traits": [
        "alchemical",
        "consumable",
        "elixir",
        "healing",
        "infused"
      ]
    }
  ],
